# Shape of .dev.vars (gitignored — never commit the real file).
# Copy to .dev.vars and fill in. For local dev `wrangler pages dev` loads these.

# HMAC key for the operator session cookie + device tokens. MUST be >= 32 chars.
# Generate one: `openssl rand -hex 32`
SESSION_SECRET=replace-with-at-least-32-random-characters-xx
